""" Notes:

Trial number:
    Number of trials in habituation: see (D.R. Bach et al. 2023).
    Number of trials in fear acquisition training: there is a possibility that the expression of US expectation changes over trials; 
    (ex SCR decaying independent of learning process) (D.R. Bach et al. 2023).
    Number of trials in extinction: see (D.R. Bach et al. 2023).
Trial order: 
    Pseudo-random: no more than 3 trials of the same type should follow in a row; 
    counterbalance the first and the last trial in terms of CS and reinforcement. 
CS/US Interval:
    Look into more.
Intertrial interval:
    Should consider the duration of CR like SCR (bach et al 2010);
    (alexander et al 2005) (modeling might help here?)
Incidental Task:
    (Ojala & Bach 2020)
Task instructions:
    General contingency instructions (Mertens, 2021, 2018).
Outcome measures: 
    Consider models (Bach 2010 )


Psychophysical task:
    forced choice for center contrast 
    or wobble

Binary counterphase flicker: 
    grating flips between 0 and pi (0 and 0.5 in psychopy phase units)
    each pixel is a square wave
    a square wave is not a single frequency; it also has odd harmonics 
    thus complicates IMs

Sinusoidal flicker:
    phase advances continuously but sampled at each frame